{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1000_p", "source_sha256": "42f8567cbf8f6a6a8b423ee3eb8cfcb4eea6c1e08ec4512f62cc1c9afe888951", "ja": "（天体公演もリピーターが増えて、波に乗ってきた。\nプロデューサー業も忙しくなってきたな……！）", "zh": "（天体公演的回头客变多，开始上轨道了。\n我这个制作人的工作也越来越忙碌……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "97ba42a3a10b055f2578663eb96065010c3f64838435a19b0812feb7aab32e91", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nこちらでしたか。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n你在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1002_p", "source_sha256": "71bbb33163b6fbd8c975b3c86de74287cde912561144b1805132d7c048d8a971", "ja": "っと……瑞希か、お疲れさま。\nどうしたんだ？", "zh": "呼……是瑞希啊，辛苦了。\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "28f55add82a76ae7652d59ac91802b7a17786f1d9a5b430bb1c019ac7f33ffd9", "ja": "{$P$}を探していました。\n具体的には、机の下や、カーテンの影などを。", "zh": "我刚刚在找{$P$}。\n具体来说，找了桌子下面，还有窗帘后面之类的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fe9f089a57b1430ff9f1286a8d43346b554fb1d11e2037a4146b4d49d779caaf", "ja": "なんでそんなところを……いや、いいけど。\n何か用事だったのか？", "zh": "为什么要去那种地方找我……算了，不追究。\n找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "0d5905db31c19ca685715468a91221e2ed81313f24d1aab2b761f30181afca16", "ja": "はい。定期公演、お疲れさまでした。\n……サジタリアス、楽しかったな。", "zh": "嗯，定期公演，辛苦你了。\n……『射手座』的演出，非常开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "7c1fe9a7a65eb1cbeea3300a08a8be538c4a22c75046efa4b4788a1780af7dde", "ja": "{$P$}のおかげで、大成功です。\nありがとうございました……よし、噛まずに言えた。", "zh": "托了{$P$}的福，表演非常成功。\n真的很谢谢你……很好，没有吃螺丝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "9150dc6d41b36ecb12fbafe78b9d84c22a225c55f8f32c46c912dba822252afd", "ja": "ということで、そのお礼も兼ねて。\nこちらを、受け取ってください……ぐいぐい。", "zh": "所以呢，当作顺便表达对你的感谢之意，\n请你收下这个……（用力塞）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1008_p", "source_sha256": "7ae430b6c307bc3a695f97711d713be02a7882e3f602aa1e59b8838c43caf737", "ja": "うん？　なんだ？　何を押し付けて……。", "zh": "嗯？这什么？你塞什么给我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_1009", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f082e5c6668fb14dbbc013971cd9e15be5d15554c952d23c5398a36b6e8ed188", "ja": "これは……石？", "zh": "这是……石头？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2001_044miz", "source_sha256": "7a2ed71f6daf5e69f4652ce4c74b8fd98ca5dada2c5d5b1585a91548f12b06a3", "ja": "はい、パワーストーンです。\n『石　伊井代』さんのお店で買いました。", "zh": "没错，是能量石。\n在『石伊井代』小姐的店买的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2002_p", "source_sha256": "31d2c35207bba3507f9b1e9589d93a4fba2684cbc9ff78ee1ca9822e19c9b7c2", "ja": "ああ、あのショッピングモールで出会った、\nすごいオーラの……。", "zh": "啊～是在购物中心遇到的\n那个气场非凡的人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2003_044miz", "source_sha256": "51c228383b3eec75be895a00b3679c157f0a9de3b03aa67d514b320e95576a9f", "ja": "はい。それは『プロデューストーン』といって、\n身につけるとプロデュース力が高まるそうです。", "zh": "没错，然后这个叫做『培育石』，\n听说戴在身上可以提升培育力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2004_p", "source_sha256": "7d216391077248437e73cfc93e0a6236f58c9c6a09c81cd758ce9de665df175c", "ja": "なんだって！？　なんてピンポイントな……！\nまさかとは思うけど、高かったりしないよな？", "zh": "你说什么！？怎么会有这么刚好的功能……！\n虽然我觉得不可能，但你该不会花了很多钱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2005_044miz", "source_sha256": "45965ab112a4dcf51e09799bacdd77d13ab911dd70191cfeba685ce95c856fb5", "ja": "……贈り物の値段は言えません。ですが、\n心配もごもっともです。なので、ヒントを……。", "zh": "……礼物的价格我不能说。\n不过，你会担心也是在所难免，所以给你个提示……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2006_044miz", "source_sha256": "d48fd1a201c8a8c35cc09f69d82308b4d30f84d3e4af1c4b16ebf7f9816fe342", "ja": "1コインです。", "zh": "我花了一枚硬币。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2007_p", "source_sha256": "4273d810733475f6bfdc3fb335f822fdbc706ff6d37344c5fad766d0ee2761b6", "ja": "そうか。\nうん、わからないけど、安心したよ！", "zh": "这样啊。\n嗯，虽然不晓得是多少钱，但我放心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2008_044miz", "source_sha256": "257c68f1eb0f66cd2a2a4dffda31cc48e73db2e6df9465152dc9d97544709f6a", "ja": "この劇場ができてから、{$P$}は\nずっと、とても忙しそうです。", "zh": "自从剧场盖好以后，{$P$}\n好像就一直忙得不可开交。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2009_044miz", "source_sha256": "feb4e0b0521d6972b2571a0a4e3480fcffe2215287e054c2b867df7d37fe3ba7", "ja": "毎日打ち合わせや、営業に出ていて……。\n私も、{$P$}の力になりたい。", "zh": "每天都是开会、外出跑业务……\n我也想帮{$P$}出一份力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2010_p", "source_sha256": "9dee70ffae7b950709c6402156618e26ee928e392a725398c2fa35442c0af1cb", "ja": "瑞希……。ありがとうな。\nおっ、本当に力が湧いてきたぞ？　石のおかげかな？", "zh": "瑞希……谢谢你啊。\n喔！真的感觉到力量源源而出耶！是多亏了这石头吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0123_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0123_2011_044miz", "source_sha256": "0ca08275e338ac1862afca826a2fcd7bce91e3f5bda39a0c606299ba3d284bce", "ja": "……よかったです。これからも私のプロデュース、\nよろしくおねまいしま……。しゅん。", "zh": "……太好了，今后也请你\n继续培育偶……（失落）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
